  message: "Merged (c907eb1a16). Behavioural evidence: the self-survey on c907eb1a16 printed neither 'CGO-LINKER linker found 53 C/C++ ...' nor the RUBY-FFI warning (0 matches in stderr; the only remaining warning is the rust-analyzer disclosure), where both fired before. The warning is narrowed, not deleted: test_partial_install_first_party.py runs run_survey on main.go + native/helper.c and gets exactly one CGO warning ('2 C/C++ function implementations'); with third_party/lib/helper.c it gets none; red check on the pre-fix code fired the CGO warning on the vendored-only fixture."  # 47b1
